; GaiaLabs Retranslation, chapter 35. Dialogue only.

?INCLUDE 'btDE_olman'
btDE_olman.dialogstring_098903! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0][SFX:0]An aged corpse lies[N]quietly…[FIN]At that moment, a familiar[N]voice spoke in my head.[FIN][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme23][DLY:2]Will. It's me. Your father[N]Olman.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme23][DLY:2]My body has totally rotted[N]away, but I still live on[N]like this…[END]`
btDE_olman.dialogstring_0989A2! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0][DLY:1]Will: D-dad…! Why are you[N]in a form like that…!?[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme23][DLY:1][DLY:2]The Tower of Babel is a[N]mysterious space. The[N]interior is full of the[N]comet's light.[FIN]Time flows at hundreds of[N]times its normal speed;[N]anybody inside evolves at[N]a terrific rate…[FIN][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0][DLY:2][DLY:1]Will: Then, how are Kara[N]and I able to survive…?![FIN][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme23][DLY:1][DLY:2]Olman: That is because[N]you two are evolved humans[N]as well.[FIN][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:2][DLY:1]Kara: We are…?[FIN][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme23][DLY:1][DLY:2]Olman: In the distant[N]past, having possession of[N]biotechnology which used[N]the light emitted from the[N]comet,[FIN]people used its power to[N]create plants and animals[N]as they desired.[FIN]For example, the camel can[N]survive for a long time[N]without food or water[N]because they were made as[N]animals for riding through[N]the desert.[FIN]Soon, humans realized that[N]this power could be used[N]to create weapons, and so[N]they gradually produced[N]demons.[FIN]Suddenly, the world was at[N]the risk of being[N]destroyed…[FIN]At that time, the Warrior[N]of Light and Darkness was[N]produced by the fate of[N]mankind; the possible[N]extermination or survival[N]of humanity.[FIN]That is your ancestor.[FIN]And the 6 Mystic Statues[N]will surely produce the[N]Warrior of Light and[N]Darkness.[FIN]Well, I'll entrust in you[N]the fated final Mystic[N]Statue.[END]`
btDE_olman.dialogstring_098CAA! `[BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme23][DLY:2]The comet will be very[N]near soon.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme23][DLY:2]I must send you both to[N]the tower's rooftop until[N]then.[FIN]Well, please quietly[PAU:28][DLY:4][N]close your eyes…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'btE4_olman'
btE4_olman.dialogstring_099068! `[BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme23][DLY:0]Olman: Ancient people[N]once worshipped the comet[N]as a god.[FIN]A mysterious power dwells[N]in things that are[N]showered in the comet's[N]light, after all.[FIN]Certainly, you could call[N]the comet a god. You could[N]also call it a singular[N]lifeform.[FIN]But it's a god that no one[N]asked for. It advances[N]things too fast, and so[N]only gives birth to[N]destruction…[FIN]As long as there is evil[N]in people's hearts, demons[N]will be born.[FIN]Well, Will, please focus[N]your eyes and take a look.[END]`
btE4_olman.dialogstring_099182! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Flute]Olman: Go. Speak with them[N]before you decide what the[N]future should mean.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'btE4_kara'
btE4_kara.dialogstring_098DFD! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,17][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: …[END]`

?INCLUDE 'btE4_olman'
btE4_olman.dialogstring_0992EC! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]Neil's father: Hey[AD][N]What in the world is[N]Neil doing?[WAI][N]That boy had better make[N]something worthwhile of[N]the Reuleck Corporation.[END]`
btE4_olman.dialogstring_0994E6! `[BOR:4][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]I've become an unaging,[N]undying organism by losing[N]my corporeal body.[FIN]I've gotten eternal life[N]through evolution by the[N]comet's light.[FIN]But what meaning could[N]there possible by in a[N]life without end?[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]I guess I felt more[N]fulfilled when I was a[N]person living in fear of[N]an incurable illness…[END]`
btE4_olman.dialogstring_09923A! `[BOR:4][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme5]Seth: Hey Will, it's[N]been a long time.[FIN]I can't believe that a[N]world like this exists…[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme5]I guess I could probably[N]have become a scholar if I[N]announced this at an[N]academic conference.[END]`
btE4_olman.dialogstring_09943E! `[BOR:4][DLG:3,17][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]Hamlet: Squee squee…!![FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,F][SIZ:D,5][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0][SFX:0]Will: So that's how it is;[N]I guess that without a[N]body, even people and[N]animals are no longer[N]distinct…[END]`
btE4_olman.dialogstring_09938D! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]Neil's mother: I can still[N]watch the living world,[N]but I cannot touch it.[WAI][N]No matter how much Neil[N]struggles, I cannot reach[N]out and lend him a hand.[END]`
btE4_olman.dialogstring_0991A9! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Flute]Olman: The moment is[N]nearly here.[WAI][N]Everyone[AD] lend your power[N]to Will and Kara.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'btE4_kara'
btE4_kara.dialogstring_098E17! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0][DLY:0]When Will and Kara's[N]hearts laid together, when[N]light and darkness became[N]one, a burgeoning power[N]was born…[FIN]The Warrior of Darkness'[N]ultimate power Firebird[N]dwells here, when the[N]Warrior of Light and[N]Darkness has revived[N]across millennia![END]`
btE4_kara.dialogstring_098EB8! `[BOR:4][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme23][DLY:0]You two, your fight will[N]change the destiny of the[N]Earth.[FIN]Well, please go.[N]To the comet…!![END]`
